**Goal.** At each decision's root the AI prices one use of the Activate of every Unit that acts face-up on either field. It ends its own turn and then the enemy's on a copy, plays the best use the reply would try at the start of each controller's next turn, and holds the price for that decision. `unit_worth` adds `AI_EVAL.activation × price`. Done when four things hold. With one removal, the AI destroys an enemy Cannon v3 rather than a bigger vanilla. It tributes a vanilla before its own Cannon v3. Face-down and hidden cards are never probed, and hidden cards change no decision (R185). The weight passes `cargo jackioh gate` at smoke size, perf gate included. All of this ships with ruling R2564000.

