1. `r2564000_an_own_cannon_is_priced_by_the_unit_its_shot_destroys`: AI field [CANNON], enemy [SORCERER]. Asserts `price ≥ unit_worth(sorcerer)` and `used` in `3..=AI_ACTIVATION_PROBE_NODES`. Also asserts that the worth with the prices held (`with_activation_prices`) equals the body plus `AI_EVAL.activation × price`, within 1e-9.
